        "https://docs.data.nasdaq.com/docs/tables-1"
      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Calls GET /datatables/QUOTEMEDIA/PRICES.json with required ticker and optional date.gte, date.lte, qopts.per_page, qopts.cursor_id. Always requests the pinned default quote columns. Returns raw JSON under data rather than the upstream {quotes} wrapper. get_real_time_quote is an alias and is omitted."
      ]
